  "description": "Provide automatic encoding and decoding of F# types to and from JSON using F# reflection\n\nThis package rely on Thoth.Json.Core, meaning you will need to pick the right additional package for your runtime:\n\n- Thoth.Json.JavaScript\n- Thoth.Json.Python\n- Thoth.Json.Newtonsoft\n- Thoth.Json.System.Text.Json",
