  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* Adds codecs (#247) ([d7322a4](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/d7322a4c40cd20bd3660e60696bd3e7024f8a972))\n* Add support for System.Uri ([a3d578e](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/a3d578ed7af595b9f302da985f361cb25e4c3d4a))\n* Add losslessOption to Codec.Auto.generateCodec ([b27cb85](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/b27cb8559c0d3a65f15cd4b0453ae5a3882c6f7d))\n* Support DateTime and DateTimeOffset decoders under Python ([a50bf27](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/a50bf272d3b372ecd2492d7873259e6d3382762b))\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n* Point auto coder errors at the current docs URL ([a5b286e](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/a5b286e3472d94be7fbce4d01b04636831b0d268))\n* Only inline Codec.Auto.generateCodec under Fable ([12627ff](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/12627ff2c33879d576a5bc3d2eeee946ac83a3ae))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/compare/7e3cf6576d8ebb5e7655e18dc8ae97ad136cee9b..581fd36fef81aaae62cdde3bf4821d2dcbc98558)</small></strong>\n\n## Unreleased\n\n### Added\n\n* Codec support",
